1, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8
*NSET, NSET=Nfix
1, 2, 3, 4
*MATERIAL, NAME=STEEL
*ELASTIC
210000., 0.3
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=Eall, MATERIAL=STEEL
*STEP
*RESTART,WRITE,OVERLAY
*STATIC
*BOUNDARY
Nfix, 3, 3, 0.
1, 1, 2, 0.
